# Every screen the title links on a desktop window: Daily (started, paused by
# Escape, Settings and How to play from the pause sheet and back, left),
# Challenges (one started and left), Score chase (a typed seed played),
# Practice setup (Expert started), Settings, Help, the theme button and the
# gardener name sheet.
# viewport 1280x800@1
until 600 Word
frames 30
click Daily. One grove
until 900 words
frames 30
save wg-daily
key Escape 1
until 120 Restart level
frames 10
save wg-pause
click =Settings
until 120 Gentle camera sway
frames 10
save wg-settings
click =Done
until 120 Restart level
frames 10
click =Help
until 120 Fill the grid
frames 10
save wg-help
click =Close
until 120 Restart level
frames 10
click =Leave round
until 300 Learn & play
frames 10
click Challenge. Move
until 300 Thrifty Sprout
frames 10
save wg-challenges
click =Play Swift Breeze
until 900 0 / 5 words
frames 30
key Escape 1
frames 5
until 120 Leave round
frames 5
click =Leave round
until 300 Learn & play
frames 10
click Score chase. Share
until 300 Seed code
frames 10
click Paste a friend
frames 5
type oak
frames 5
click =Play seed
until 900 0 / 8 words
frames 20
save wg-chase
key Escape 1
until 120 Leave round
frames 5
click =Leave round
until 300 Learn & play
frames 10
click Practice. Unranked
until 120 Nothing here affects
frames 10
click Expert — 7 letters, large grid
frames 5
click =Start
until 900 0 / 9 words
frames 20
save wg-practice
key Escape 1
until 120 Leave round
frames 5
click =Leave round
until 300 Learn & play
frames 10
click Theme: Dawn
frames 10
click Help
until 120 Fair play
frames 10
click =Close
frames 10
click =Gardener
until 120 Gardener name
frames 10
save wg-name
click =Cancel
frames 10
click Settings
until 120 Replay tutorial
frames 10
click =Done
frames 10
save wg-title-back
